#: includes/class-privacy.php:133
msgid "When you use the live chat on this website, we store your messages and the details you enter (such as your name, email address and phone number), the pages you viewed on this site before and during the chat, and your browser's user agent, so we can answer you. If enabled, we also store your IP address. This data is stored on our own server and is not sent to any third-party chat service."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-privacy.php:134
msgid "Your browser keeps the last pages you viewed on this site during your visit in local storage; they are sent to us only if you start a chat, so we can see where you need help. After you start a chat, your browser also keeps a random code for up to 30 days so you can continue the chat on other pages. No cookies are used. If you give your email address, we may send you our replies and, when you ask for it, a copy of the chat by email."
msgstr ""

